  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oye, tú! Sí, pareces un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa bien fuerte.\n¡Mira qué Puerros más hermosos tengo hoy!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Conoces por casualidad a un Pokémon que se\nllama Farfetch’d?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0043006F006E006F00630065007300200070006F0072002000630061007300750061006C00690064006100640020006100200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007100750065002000730065000A006C006C0061006D006100200046006100720066006500740063006820190064003F00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre lleva consigo una hortaliza que blande\na veces como si fuera una espada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que corre un rumor inquietante sobre\nlos Puerros y los Farfetch’d.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicen que, si llevas un solo Farfetch’d de noche\na cierto lugar y lo equipas con un Puerro...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Unos tipos te atacan por sorpresa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y como tienes pinta de ser muy fuerte, quiero que\nvayas allí y les des una lección.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nToma, aquí tienes un Puerro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para encontrarte con esos bribones, tienes que ir\nde <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>noche<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> al <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>sector 7 del Distrito Rojo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> con <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>un solo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Farfetch’d<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> que lleve equipado un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Puerro<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 34,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recuerda los detalles de la misión:<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPara encontrarte con esos bribones, tienes que ir\nde <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>noche<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> al <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>sector 7 del Distrito Rojo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> con <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>un solo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Farfetch’d<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> que lleve equipado un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Puerro<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 34,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 224
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hete aquí Puerro en mano en mitad de la noche.\n¡Esto clama a un duelo entre Farfetch’d!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero bueno, ¡¿y ese Puerro enorme?! ¿Acaso es\nun Farfetch’d de Galar?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F002C002000A100BF00790020006500730065002000500075006500720072006F00200065006E006F0072006D0065003F0021002000BF0041006300610073006F002000650073000A0075006E00200046006100720066006500740063006820190064002000640065002000470061006C00610072003F00100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Feeetch!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600650065006500740063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡En guardia! ¡Mi Puerro es mi ley!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006E002000670075006100720064006900610021002000A1004D0069002000500075006500720072006F0020006500730020006D00690020006C00650079002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por cierto...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0072002000630069006500720074006F002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Resulta que eres más hábil de lo que parecías!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006500730075006C007400610020007100750065002000650072006500730020006D00E100730020006800E100620069006C0020006400650020006C006F002000710075006500200070006100720065006300ED00610073002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has afrontado mi emboscada sin perder el temple\ny blandiendo el Puerro con maestría. Salta a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla vista que no eres un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa corriente.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te encomiendo por tu victoria contra él.\nHas demostrado una habilidad asombrosa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero ahora habrás de ponerla a prueba contra\ntodos mis largos años de experiencia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La derrota de mi compañero la siento como mía,\npor lo que me veo obligado a defender mi honor.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Puerro qué ven mis ojos?! ¿Un Farfetch’d de\nGalar? En fin, no me queda más remedio...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Feeetch!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600650065006500740063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por mi Puerro, no retrocederé!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F00720020006D0069002000500075006500720072006F002C0020006E006F00200072006500740072006F0063006500640065007200E9002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me rindo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0065002000720069006E0064006F002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya fuerza tan descomunal... Me pregunto\ncuánto habrás entrenado para llegar a ese nivel.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que has logrado derrotarlos a ambos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED002000710075006500200068006100730020006C006F0067007200610064006F00200064006500720072006F007400610072006C006F00730020006100200061006D0062006F0073002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué deshonra para los Tres Espuerrochines...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500E900200064006500730068006F006E00720061002000700061007200610020006C006F00730020005400720065007300200045007300700075006500720072006F006300680069006E00650073002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En realidad, yo soy Bushi, el tercer integrante\ndel grupo. El más fuerte de los tres, de hecho.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te pienso mostrar cómo se lía a \"mampuerros\"\nun Farfetch’d de Kanto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400650020007000690065006E0073006F0020006D006F007300740072006100720020006300F3006D006F0020007300650020006C00ED00610020006100200022006D0061006D00700075006500720072006F00730022000A0075006E002000460061007200660065007400630068201900640020006400650020004B0061006E0074006F002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me importa un pimiento que lleves un Farfetch’d\nde Galar!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTe voy a enseñar cómo se las gastan en Kanto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000720065007000E10072006100740065002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Feeetch!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600650065006500740063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mi Puerro es mi honra!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0069002000500075006500720072006F0020006500730020006D006900200068006F006E00720061002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Impresionante!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10049006D00700072006500730069006F006E0061006E00740065002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar, far, far!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460061006100610072002C0020006600610072002C002000660061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je, je, je...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002C0020006A0065002C0020006A0065002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ha sido un combate de lo más maravilloso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004800610020007300690064006F00200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400650020006400650020006C006F0020006D00E100730020006D00610072006100760069006C006C006F0073006F002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdona, pero es que nosotros tres somos fans\nde \"El Puerro del inmortal\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre ha sido nuestro sueño librar un combate\nPokémon recreándolo como lo hacen en la peli.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mas no encontrábamos Entrenadores con un\nFarfetch’d digno de enfrentarse a nosotros.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hasta que apareciste tú! Y te dirigiste a ese\ncallejón sin pensártelo dos veces.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te dimos más detalles para dotar de realismo\na la situación y que se palpara en el ambiente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siento de veras haberte engañado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690065006E0074006F0020006400650020007600650072006100730020006800610062006500720074006500200065006E0067006100F100610064006F002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sea como fuere, ¡te agradezco en el alma que nos\nhayas ayudado a hacer realidad nuestro sueño!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por fin he podido recrear la emoción de\nla película!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0072002000660069006E00200068006500200070006F006400690064006F002000720065006300720065006100720020006C006100200065006D006F0063006900F3006E002000640065000A006C0061002000700065006C00ED00630075006C0061002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y nuestros Farfetch’d también han dado la talla.\n¡Ha sido un auténtico espectáculo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
